# Captain Burak's pre-fight lines, approved by the user. The "do" line plays his warning shot (in
# BurakBossIntro.gd), and the dialogue waits for it to finish before the next line.
# The tags drive him: `captain` sets his talk pose on any speaker's line, and `glance` turns him toward
# ringside until the next `captain`. Never [wait=N] or "do wait(N)" in here: both run on a SceneTree timer,
# which ticks through the pause screen and which the hold-to-skip can't run out. A pause is a beat.

~ start
Captain Burak: Ahoy, newcomer! Welcome aboard the server. [#captain=smug]
Burak: ...who are you supposed to be?
Captain Burak: ScurvyCumslinger to you newcomer. [#captain=point]
Burak: ...
Captain Burak: You want a shot at the other members? You wanna meet our king Jordan? You'll have to get through me pal [#captain=shrug]
do warning_shot()
Captain Burak: Hah! Relax, kiddo. I'll go easy on ya. [#captain=laugh]
=> END
